    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The text names it a rule path Immortal Gu, and placing it on that time path secluded domain of heaven and earth is difficult. Immortal Gu Suppression, at rank eight, is one of the formation’s core Immortal Gu and must be the first rank eight Immortal Gu arranged there. The three layers of supplementary formation exist only to help it find the proper area; after it is set they are dismantled to make space for later steps such as the pale fire formation.",
