  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On the River of Time, Heavenly Court’s second work group adds Immortal Gu Suppression onto three finished supplementary formations while building the river suppression lotus sealing formation.",
        "chapters": [
          1882
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_river_of_time",
          "fac_heavenly_court"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Before the fate war, Fang Yuan fights Heavenly Court Gu Immortals on the River of Time. In one battle he destroys the river suppression lotus sealing formation and obtains suppression Gu from it. Suppression Gu is rank eight.",
        "chapters": [
          2189
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "obtained-by-fang-yuan",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_immortal"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Inside Limitless’ Crazed Demon formation, Fang Yuan uses the immortal killer move Calm and Steady. That move requires two main cores, calm Gu and suppression Gu. Fang Yuan has suppression Gu. With fortitude Gu substituted for missing calm Gu, the two rank eight cores strengthen the move beyond fortitude Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          2189
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "calm-and-steady-core",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_crazed_demon_formation",
          "move_calm_and_steady",
          "gu_calm_gu",
          "gu_fortitude_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "See also River Suppression Lotus Sealing Formation.",
